ータが取得でき次第、ここに自動で表示されます。</div><div class=\"nhead\">板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(26年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"79.2\" width=\"320\" height=\"2.799999999999997\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,97.2 9.1,85.3 14.2,81.9 19.3,81.1 24.5,75.9 29.6,73.4 34.7,74.0 39.8,70.4 44.9,67.7 50.0,67.6 55.1,69.2 60.3,68.9 65.4,66.7 70.5,57.9 75.6,55.5 80.7,28.6 85.8,29.1 91.0,47.3 96.1,36.0 101.2,38.4 106.3,36.0 111.4,36.4 116.5,38.5 121.6,29.9 126.8,29.3 131.9,31.1 137.0,18.1 142.1,12.8 147.2,17.5 152.3,25.9 157.4,24.5 162.6,27.7 167.7,32.4 172.8,29.3 177.9,28.3 183.0,34.2 188.1,35.9 193.2,35.4 198.4,33.6 203.5,33.8 208.6,34.1 213.7,32.7 218.8,31.4 223.9,26.8 229.0,14.2 234.2,21.5 239.3,26.6 244.4,29.0 249.5,39.7 254.6,36.4 259.7,28.4 264.9,24.5 270.0,21.4 275.1,21.7 280.2,22.0 285.3,26.0 290.4,33.8 295.5,48.4 300.7,65.1 305.8,61.3 310.9,71.5 316.0,67.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 109.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 109.2 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 295.5 60.4 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"67.4\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.o